@base = http://localhost:5005

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### 1. Order place karein (200)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "customerEmail": "asha@example.com",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "MUG-001", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 2500 }
  ]
}

### 2. Same order dobara (200, naya order nahi banega)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "customerEmail": "asha@example.com",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "MUG-001", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 2500 }
  ]
}
### 3. Expected: 200, status: Confirmed, totalAmount: 5000 (client ka unitPrice: 1 ignore hona chahiye).

POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "dddddddd-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "customerEmail": "saga@example.com",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "MUG-001", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 1 } ]
}

### 4. Order fetch karein (200)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders/aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 5. Galat email (400)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "customerEmail": "",
  "lines": []
}

### 6. Order nahi mila (404)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/orders/bbbbbbbb-0000-0000-0000-000000000009
